  "document": {
    "title": "File creation ownership in iiSDKBuilder",
    "role": "guide",
    "authority": "markdown_source"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b000001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "start_line": 1,
      "end_line": 1,
      "raw": "# File creation ownership in iiSDKBuilder\n",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "File creation ownership in iiSDKBuilder"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000002",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 2,
      "end_line": 2,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 5,
      "raw": "소스는 `src/Build/`, `src/Core/`, `src/Resources/`, `src/Targets/`,\n`src/HLS/`로 책임에 따라 구분한다. 공개 헤더와 대응 구현은 함께 두며,\n빌드와 설치 소비자의 `<iiSDKBuilder/...>` 경로는 유지한다.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 6,
      "end_line": 6,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 7,
      "end_line": 7,
      "raw": "CMake query files, project identity/report JSON and platform process logs use native provider streams and provider atomic publication. Build orchestration and platform-kit rules stay in Builder.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000006",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 8,
      "end_line": 8,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 9,
      "end_line": 12,
      "raw": "The common [ownership contract](../../iiFileProvider/docs/FILE_OWNERSHIP.md) defines stream, staging, control-file and\ninstalled-package rules. Source regression tests remain with this module; the\nworkspace creation audit also checks these boundaries. Build/deployment and target\nruntime validation are separate evidence.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000008",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 13,
      "end_line": 13,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 14,
      "end_line": 14,
      "raw": "Changed boundaries:\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000010",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 15,
      "end_line": 16,
      "raw": "\n\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000011",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 17,
      "end_line": 19,
      "raw": "- `src/Build/Builder.cpp`\n- `src/Core/Json.cpp`\n- `src/Build/Process.cpp`\n",
      "items": [
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "`src/Build/Builder.cpp`",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "`src/Core/Json.cpp`",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "`src/Build/Process.cpp`",
          "checked": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b000012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "start_line": 20,
      "end_line": 20,
      "raw": "# Core foundation migration (0.13)\n",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "Core foundation migration (0.13)"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000013",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 21,
      "end_line": 21,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 22,
      "end_line": 26,
      "raw": "Builder's JSON/manifests/reports use `iiFileProvider::native::File::write` directly.\nAtomic file implementation no longer comes from iiSDKCore. The existing Native\ndependency supplies atomic publication and file presentation; Core remains a\nlower runtime dependency. `iiSDKBuilder.json` verifies replacement and failure\npreservation in addition to JSON parsing.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000015",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 27,
      "end_line": 27,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "start_line": 28,
      "end_line": 28,
      "raw": "## Shared process runner (0.1.1)\n",
      "level": 2,
      "title": "Shared process runner (0.1.1)"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000017",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 29,
      "end_line": 29,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 30,
      "end_line": 33,
      "raw": "Core 0.15 owns the child process and nonblocking standard pipes. Builder writes\nthe merged output sink through Native OutputFile, including close/presentation\nnotification, and flushes before reporting success. No raw file handles are\npassed to Core and no log file creation is moved into the foundation module.\n"
    }
  ],
